 sus siervos, y se levantaron y se fueron juntos a Beerseba; y habitó Abraham en Beerseba.", "words": [[0, 193931], [2, 194039], [9, 194539], [17, 195039], [19, 195199], [23, 195359], [32, 195959], [34, 196219], [37, 196319], [48, 197119], [50, 197699], [53, 197819], [60, 198039], [67, 198579], [69, 199134], [79, 199938], [81, 200100], [88, 200680], [96, 201240], [99, 202052]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 203270, "end": 211591, "text": "Y aconteció después de estas cosas, que informaron a Abraham, diciendo: He aquí que también Milca ha parido hijos a Nacor tu hermano:", "words": [[0, 203270], [2, 203415], [12, 204095], [20, 204415], [23, 204615], [29, 204795], [36, 205215], [40, 205495], [51, 206235], [53, 206395], [62, 206875], [72, 208376], [75, 208456], [80, 208656], [84, 208836], [92, 209236], [98, 209636], [101, 209776], [108, 210116], [114, 210346], [116, 210576], [122, 210806], [125, 211036]]}, {"verse": 21, "start": 212041, "end": 216305, "text": "A Huz su primogénito, y a Buz su hermano, y a Kemuel padre de Aram,", "words": [[0, 212155], [2, 212295], [6, 212435], [9, 212575], [22, 213375], [24, 213615], [26, 213855], [30, 214095], [33, 214255], [42, 214545], [44, 214835], [46, 215125], [53, 215415], [59, 215655], [62, 215895]]}, {"verse": 22, "start": 216755, "end": 220638, "text": "Y a Quesed, y a Hazo, y a Pildas, y a Jidlaf, y a Betuel.", "words": [[0, 216755], [2, 216897], [4, 217247], [12, 217597], [14, 217617], [16, 217987], [22, 218357], [24, 218357], [26, 218437], [34, 219297], [36, 219297], [38, 219677], [46, 220057], [48, 220097], [50, 220177]]}, {"verse": 23, "start": 220988, "end": 228094, "text": "Y Betuel engendró a Rebeca. Estos ocho parió Milca a Nacor, hermano de Abraham.", "words": [[0, 220988], [2, 221175], [9, 221635], [18, 222155], [20, 222676], [28, 223434], [34, 223924], [39, 224444], [45, 225004], [51, 225564], [53, 226124], [60, 226684], [68, 227204], [71, 227665]]}, {"verse": 24, "start": 228544, "end": 236140, "text": "Y su concubina,